:: Danny Room Door
<<set _loc to getDannyLocation()>>
<<if _loc is "sleep">>
A note on the door: "Sleeping. Please don't wake me."
<<link [[Leave|Bedroom]]>><</link>>
<<elseif _loc is "work">>
A note: "At Niki's photography. Back later."
<<link [[Leave|Bedroom]]>><</link>>
<<elseif _loc is "school" or _loc is "walk" or _loc is "canteen" or _loc is "courtyard">>
A note: "At school. Back later."
<<link [[Leave|Bedroom]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link [[Knock and enter|Danny Room]]>><</link>>
<<link [[Leave|Bedroom]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Danny Room
You enter Danny's room.
<<link [[Leave|Bedroom]]>><</link>>

:: Danny First Meeting Canteen
In the canteen Danny nearly bumps into you.
"S-sorry! I'm Danny. We both live at the orphanage, right?"
<<link [[Continue|School Canteen]]>><<set $dannyIntro to 1>><</link>>

:: Widgets Danny [widget]
<<widget "dannyroom_link">>
  <<if getDannyLocation() is "sleep">>
    <<bedroomicon>><<link [[Danny's room (locked)|Danny Room Door]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
  <<else>>
    <<bedroomicon>><<link [[Danny's room (0:01)|Danny Room Door]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
  <</if>>
  <br>
<</widget>>

:: Widgets Danny Init [widget]
<<widget "dannyInit">>
	<<if C.npc.Danny>>
		<<if C.npc.Danny.continence is undefined>>
			<<set C.npc.Danny.continence to 3000>>
		<</if>>
		<<if C.npc.Danny.acceptance is undefined>>
			<<set C.npc.Danny.acceptance to 200>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>
